Flexible Software Package (FSP)
###############################

Origin:
   Renesas Electronics Corporation
   https://www.renesas.com/us/en/software-tool/flexible-software-package-fsp

Status:
   Version 1.0.0-beta.1

Purpose:
   Flexible Software Package (FSP) for Renesas RX MCU Family.

Description:
   This package is a snapshot from the RX FSP software released by Renesas Electronics Corporation
   It contain the HAL and a set of CMSIS headers files for the Renesas RX MCUs

Dependencies:
    None.

URL:
   N/A

Commit:
   N/A

Maintained-by:
   Renesas Electronics Corporation

License:
   BSD-3-Clause

License Link:
   https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause

Patch List:

   * Remove the inclusion of bsp_linker_info.h since it is not used by Zephyr
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/bsp/mcu/all/bsp_common.h
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/bsp/mcu/all/bsp_mcu_api.h

   * Modify to use ".noinit" instead of ".ram_noinit" for `BSP_SECTION_NOINIT`
     so it matches Zephyr's default linker script and avoids an orphan section
     warning
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/bsp/mcu/all/bsp_compiler_support.h

   * Adapt BSP_ICU_IRQ_HANDLER for Zephyr: remove "setpsw i" and "rte", and
     pass the IRQ number as a register operand to allow runtime values
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/bsp/mcu/all/bsp_irq.h

   * Define the writable `g_bsp_group_irq_callback_list` in bsp_group_irq.c and
     declare it in bsp_group_irq.h, instead of the `const` table generated in
     vector_data.c, so the Zephyr driver can register callbacks at runtime
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/bsp/mcu/all/bsp_group_irq.c
      drivers/rx/fsp/src/bsp/mcu/all/bsp_group_irq.h
